        "name": "Voob Gooblin",
        "username": "Voob_Gooblin",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/voob_gooblin/{size}/2504_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-21T18:45:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ambuscade has been incapacitated, one nemesis card remains in play, deck and trash removed from the game.</p><p>If Tempest plays \"Into the Stratosphere\" on the remaining nemesis card, does that card:</p><p><span>A) get removed from the game, since Ambuscade's incapacitated side specifies that any nemeses that <em>would leave play</em> are removed from the game, or</span></p><p><span>B) stay put, since there is no villain deck for the nemesis to go to, negating ItS's effect.</span></p><p><span>Thanks!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:11.047Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
