        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Ambuscade has been incapacitated, one nemesis card remains in play, deck and trash removed from the game.</p><p>If Tempest plays &quot;Into the Stratosphere&quot; on the remaining nemesis card, does that card:</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">A) get removed from the game, since Ambuscade&#39;s incapacitated side specifies that any nemeses that <em>would leave play</em> are removed from the game, or</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">B) stay put, since there is no villain deck for the nemesis to go to, negating ItS&#39;s effect.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Thanks!</span></p>",
